  "articleBody": "A productive remodeling consultation turns your goals, existing conditions, budget priorities, and property constraints into a clearer project path. Bring measurements, inspiration images, a wish list, and questions about design, permits, construction, selections, communication, and costs. The meeting should also reveal whether the provider’s process and scope fit your San Diego County home.",
